    "title": "Quick Start",
    "html": "<p>Check out <a href=\"https://nodered.org/docs/getting-started/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://nodered.org/docs/getting-started/</a> for full instructions on getting\nstarted.</p>\n<ol>\n<li><code>sudo npm install -g --unsafe-perm node-red</code></li>\n<li><code>node-red</code></li>\n<li>Open <a href=\"http://localhost:1880\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">http://localhost:1880</a></li>\n</ol>\n<br /><blockquote>\n<p>[!NOTE]\nMore documentation can be found <a href=\"https://nodered.org/docs\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>. For further help, or general discussion, please join the <a href=\"https://discourse.nodered.org\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Node-RED Forum</a> or <a href=\"https://nodered.org/slack\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Node-RED Slack</a>.</p>\n</blockquote>",
